   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Disney is an example of a diversified company. Its success is based upon founder Walt Disney’s artistic abilities and years of successful strategic planning. Answer the following questions:\n<ol style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha; margin-left:1.5em;padding-left:1.5em;\">\n<li>Why has it been important for Disney to identify new products and markets?</li>\n<li>How has Disney leveraged its strengths to pursue new opportunities?</li>\n<li>In addition to parks and resorts, list three products/services Disney has expanded into.</li>\n<li>In your opinion, is Disney an example of an ethical company that practices a double bottom line?</li>\n</ol>",
